# Dynamic CRM Project - Cursor Rules

## 🎯 Project Overview

This is a **Real Estate CRM application** built with:
- **Frontend**: Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Shadcn/UI
- **Backend**: tRPC for type-safe APIs
- **Database**: Supabase (PostgreSQL) - integration in progress
- **Maps**: Google Maps API - prepared, needs API key
- **Package Manager**: pnpm with monorepo structure

## 📂 Project Structure

```
/workspace
├── apps/
│   └── web/                    # Next.js application
│       ├── app/
│       │   ├── (app)/          # CRM pages (44 pages)
│       │   │   ├── admin/      # User management, roles, settings
│       │   │   ├── analytics/  # Analytics dashboard
│       │   │   ├── calendar/   # Calendar events
│       │   │   ├── calls/      # Call tracking
│       │   │   ├── dashboard/  # 6 role-based dashboards
│       │   │   ├── leads/      # Lead management
│       │   │   ├── loyalty/    # Loyalty program
│       │   │   ├── marketplace/# Marketplace listings
│       │   │   ├── matching/   # Lead-property matching
│       │   │   ├── properties/ # Property management + map
│       │   │   └── tasks/      # Task management
│       │   └── api/trpc/       # tRPC API endpoint
│       ├── components/
│       │   ├── layout/         # App shell, sidebar, header
│       │   └── ui/             # Shadcn/UI components
│       └── lib/
│           ├── mock-data.ts    # Development mock data
│           ├── trpc-server.ts  # Server-side tRPC routers
│           ├── trpc.ts         # Client-side tRPC
│           └── utils.ts        # Utility functions
├── docs/architecture/          # Completion reports
├── package.json               # Root package.json
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml        # Monorepo config
└── turbo.json                 # Turborepo config
```

## ✅ Current Status (Phase 5 Complete)

**44 CRM Pages Built:**
- Dashboards (6): Agent, Team Lead, Owner, Admin, Call Center, Marketplace
- Leads (5): List, Detail, New, Edit, Import
- Properties (8): Catalog, Map, Detail, New, Edit, Schedule, Import, Analytics
- Matching (3): Workbench, Lead matches, Settings
- Tasks (5): List, Detail, New, Calendar, Team
- Calendar (4): Main, Detail, New, Settings
- Calls (2): List, Detail
- Admin (5): Users, Roles, Settings, Audit, System
- Analytics (1): Dashboard
- Loyalty (3): Dashboard, Leaderboard, Rewards
- Marketplace (2): List, Detail

**Backend Status:**
- ✅ tRPC routers implemented for all modules
- ⚠️ Currently using mock data (lib/mock-data.ts)
- 🔄 Phase 6: Replace with real Supabase queries

**Google Maps:**
- ✅ Package installed (@react-google-maps/api)
- ⚠️ Needs API key in .env.local: `NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=`
- 📍 Map page: /properties/map

